# Go Service Template Source Files

Generated outputs for scaffolded Go services:
- Go microservice with gRPC + protobuf
- Dockerfile (multi-stage, distroless)  
- K8s manifests (base + overlays via Kustomize)
- Terraform module (EKS namespace, IAM role)
- GitHub Actions CI/CD (build, test, scan, deploy)
- Full Makefile with standard targets
